  },
  {
   "id": "popTimer",
   "type": "timer",
   "params": {
    "interval": 0.16,
    "autostart": false,
    "repeat": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tagText",
   "type": "lookup",
   "params": {
    "values": [
     "RECRUIT",
     "SOLDIER",
     "VETERAN",
     "SUPERSOLDIER",
     "POST-HUMAN",
     "IMPOSSIBLE"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "descText",
   "type": "lookup",
   "params": {
    "values": [
     "A WALK IN THE PARK. THE COMBAT SUIT WILL HELP TO KEEP YOU ALIVE.",
     "ENEMIES FIGHT BACK. USE THE ARMOR AND THE CLOAK WISELY.",
     "HOSTILES FLANK AND SUPPRESS. MISTAKES ARE PUNISHED QUICKLY.",
     "NO CROSSHAIR, NO HIT MARKERS. THE ENEMY SPEAKS ITS OWN LANGUAGE.",
     "ONE LIFE. SUIT ENERGY DRAINS FAST AND THE ENEMY NEVER MISSES.",
     "NOTHING WILL SAVE YOU. EVERY SHOT IS LETHAL, EVERY SHADOW IS HOSTILE."
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "hintText",
   "type": "lookup",
   "params": {
    "values": [
     "A GOOD PLACE TO LEARN WHAT THE SUIT CAN DO.",
     "THE WAY THE JUNGLE WAS MEANT TO BE FOUGHT.",
     "FOR THOSE WHO ALREADY KNOW THE JUNGLE.",
     "NO ASSISTS. TRUST YOUR INSTINCTS.",
     "ONLY THE SUIT WILL REMEMBER YOUR NAME.",
     "NO SUIT CAN SAVE YOU HERE. WHY ARE YOU TRYING?"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "imageTone",
   "type": "lookup",
   "params": {
    "values": [
     "opacity: 1.00",
     "opacity: 0.95",
     "opacity: 0.88",
     "opacity: 0.80",
     "opacity: 0.72",
     "opacity: 0.62"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "introT",
   "type": "timer",
   "params": {
    "interval": 0.15,
    "autostart": true,
    "repeat": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "parked",
   "type": "toggle",
   "params": {
    "initial": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "listParked",
   "type": "constant",
   "params": {
    "value": -650
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "listFree",
   "type": "constant",
   "params": {
    "value": 0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "listShift",
   "type": "select"
  },
  {
